invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_auth.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: the TRUST=webpki build has no chain walk yet, and its
  placeholder returns CH_OK instead of failing closed, so the handshake
  goes on to Finished with no certificate checked. The change that adds
  webpki.c replaces the placeholder, and must replace this violation
  with one against the walk. bin/webpki_session_test's fail-closed
  handshake objects.

--- old
    h->alert = ALERT_INTERNAL_ERROR;
    return CH_EAUTH;
#else
--- new
    h->alert = ALERT_INTERNAL_ERROR;
    return CH_OK;
#else
